#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq21.rst:16 8367446e99ce4237a92113dc1af566ff
msgid "21-band graphic equalizer audio effect."
msgstr "21 段均衡器预设。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq21.rst:21 5f1941060bfc46f3bbe80f92d113ab10
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq21.rst:23 bc2632bb4df044bebe5c8689b156b754
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ21 is a 21-band graphic equalizer using FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It provides "
"professional-grade frequency equalization across twenty-one bands spanning from 22Hz to 22000Hz."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectEQ21**    是    ``FmodAudioEffectEQ``    的 21 频段预设版本。默认频段从    ``22``    Hz 延伸到"
"    ``22000``    Hz。它继承    ``FmodAudioEffectEQ``    的全部属性和方法。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq21.rst:25 6f3aa139320145b7a5fb08438d111fa7
msgid ""
"Each band can be individually adjusted for gain (-60 dB to +24 dB), frequency, Q value, and "
"filter type. By default, all bands use peaking filters with a Q value of 0.707."
msgstr "每个频段均可独立设置增益（-60 dB 到 +24 dB）、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。默认使用 Q 值为 0.707 的峰值滤波器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq21.rst:27 65e87f5cc7f545b7a92aefe5a9eca700
msgid ""
"The frequency bands are: 22Hz, 32Hz, 44Hz, 63Hz, 90Hz, 125Hz, 175Hz, 250Hz, 350Hz, 500Hz, 700Hz, "
"1000Hz, 1400Hz, 2000Hz, 2800Hz, 4000Hz, 5600Hz, 8000Hz, 11000Hz, 16000Hz, and 22000Hz."
msgstr ""
"频段中心频率依次为 22、32、44、63、90、125、175、250、350、500、700、1000、1400、2000、2800、4000、5600、8000、11000、16000 和"
" 22000 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq21.rst:29 56dc111917bf40eaa8bd94aa22745398
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** This equalizer uses multiple MULTIBAND_EQ DSP units internally (each supports 5 "
"bands). For simpler control, use :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ6<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ6>` or "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ10<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ10>`."
msgstr ""
"**注意：**    内部使用多个 MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 单元，每个单元支持 5 个频段。较简单的控制可使用    "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ6<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ6>`    或    "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ10<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ10>`   。"

